{"CommitteeCode":"J10","FullName":"Joint Committee on Municipalities and Regional Government","ShortName":"Municipalities and Regional Government (J)","Description":"It shall be the duty of the committee on Municipalities and Regional Government to consider matters seeking the enactment of special laws for a city or town, the establishment of economic, district and local planning commissions, rent control and zoning, and matters concerning the various counties, former counties and regional government entities, including the salaries and tenure of employees, registers of deeds and sheriffs (but excluding the retirement of such employees) and such other matters as may be referred. ","Branch":"Joint","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"SenateChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"JRO0","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0"},"HouseChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"CAF1","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAF1"},"DocumentsBeforeCommittee":[{"BillNumber":"H5034","DocketNumber":"HD5322","Title":"An Act establishing a festival of the hills committee for the town of Conway","PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-15T16:41:32.7633333"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-15T16:41:32.78"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-08-15T16:41:32.7633333"},"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5034","IsDocketBookOnly":false},{"BillNumber":"S2945","DocketNumber":"SD3405","Title":"An Act amending Chapter 396 of the Acts of 2008 \r\n